ch"', 'text': 'AUGUSTA, GA., JUNE 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0E-Z-GO WILL AGAIN BE THE RIDE OF CHOICE FOR "CAPITAL ONE\'S THE MATCH," THE EMMY-WINNING SERIES OF TELEVISED LIVE GOLF COMPETITIONS THAT PIT GOLF ICONS AND PROFESSIONAL ATHLETES AGAINST EACH OTHER ON WORLD-RENOWNED COURSES TO SUPPORT CHARITIES AND COMMUNITIES NATIONWIDE.'}{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2021-06-29 16:45:00-04:56', 'title': 'Truist announces planned dividend increase and reduced stress capital buffer following release of 2021 CCAR results', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., JUNE 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRUIST FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NYSE: TFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED A PLANNED 7% INCREASE IN THE REGULAR QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND FROM $0.45 PER SHARE TO $0.48 PER SHARE, FOLLOWING THE COMPLETION OF THE 2021 COMPREHENSIVE CAPITAL ANALYSIS AND REVIEW (CCAR) PROCESS.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2021-06-29 17:10:00-04:56', 'title': 'U.S. Bancorp Receives Stress Capital Buffer Requirement of 2.5 Percent; Recommends Dividend Increase of 9.5 Percent', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--U.S. BANCORP RECEIVES STRESS CAPITAL BUFFER REQUIREMENT OF 2.5 PERCENT; RECOMMENDS DIVIDEND INCREASE OF 9.5 PERCENT'}{'symbol': 'VTR', 'date': '2021-06-29 16:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Ardent Health Services Appoints Richardson Chief Operating Officer', 'text': 'NASHVILLE, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ARDENT HEALTH SERVICES HAS APPOINTED TERIKA RICHARDSON CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, EFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 7.'}{'symbol': 'VRSK', 'date': '2021-06-29 09:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Verisk LightSpeed Accelerator Added to Guidewire Marketplace Enabling Personal Auto Insurers to Transform Customer Experiences', 'text': 'QUALITY DATA AND SUPERIOR WORKFLOW DRIVE ONE-RATE QUOTING IN SECONDS QUALITY DATA AND SUPERIOR WORKFLOW DRIVE ONE-RATE QUOTING IN SECONDS'}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2021-06-29 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Catalina connects with Verizon Media to advance measurement in a cookieless world', 'text': "CATALINA'S VAST CPG SHOPPER INTELLIGENCE NOW INT